      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quelque chose me dit que tu es d’Illumis, toi...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005100750065006C007100750065002000630068006F007300650020006D0065002000640069007400200071007500650020007400750020006500730020006420190049006C006C0075006D00690073002C00200074006F0069002E002E002E00100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Excuse-moi, je vais être direct, mais aurais-tu\nun Ramoloss en ta possession ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je viens de Galar, vois-tu, et les Ramoloss de chez\nmoi ont les extrémités jaunes, comme celui-ci.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais j’ai entendu dire que ce n’était pas le cas\npartout...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0061006900730020006A20190061006900200065006E00740065006E006400750020006400690072006500200071007500650020006300650020006E201900E9007400610069007400200070006100730020006C00650020006300610073000A0070006100720074006F00750074002E002E002E00100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai aussi cru comprendre que des Ramoloss\nsauvages avaient fait leur apparition à Illumis.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Puisque je suis de passage, ce serait dommage de\nrentrer à Galar sans en ajouter un à mon équipe !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je serais donc ravi d’échanger mon Ramoloss\nde Galar contre un Ramoloss local !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si tu as déjà capturé un Ramoloss à Illumis,\néchange-le avec moi, s’il te plaît.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Es-tu d’accord pour échanger ton Ramoloss\ncontre mon Ramoloss de Galar ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oui !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00750069002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je ne préfère pas.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A00650020006E006500200070007200E9006600E8007200650020007000610073002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Formidable ! Échangeons, alors !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0046006F0072006D0069006400610062006C006500200021002000C9006300680061006E00670065006F006E0073002C00200061006C006F007200730020002100100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu es sûr<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe ? Les Ramoloss de Galar sont\ndes Pokémon assez rares ici, tu sais...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Permets-moi de te rappeler que je recherche\nun Ramoloss qui ne vient pas de Galar.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Incroyable ! Non seulement il est d’une autre\ncouleur, mais même son odeur est différente !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais surtout, quelle corpulence !!!\nIls font tous cette taille, par chez vous ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je pensais que seule la couleur serait différente !\nMe voilà bien surpris !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mo ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006F0020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Par contre, s’il y a bien une chose qu’ils ont en\ncommun, c’est ce regard parfaitement vide !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Merci infiniment de m’avoir confié ce merveilleux\nspécimen de Ramoloss !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On m’a dit que lorsqu’ils évoluent en Flagadoss,\nleurs différences sont encore plus flagrantes !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Par exemple, ceux de Galar prennent le type\nPoison, et puis...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006100720020006500780065006D0070006C0065002C00200063006500750078002000640065002000470061006C006100720020007000720065006E006E0065006E00740020006C006500200074007900700065000A0050006F00690073006F006E002C00200065007400200070007500690073002E002E002E00100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oups ! Je ne veux pas trop en dire, ce serait te\ngâcher la découverte !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Prends bien soin de mon Ramoloss de Galar !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005000720065006E006400730020006200690065006E00200073006F0069006E0020006400650020006D006F006E002000520061006D006F006C006F00730073002000640065002000470061006C006100720020002100100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Encore merci pour cet échange. Prends bien\nsoin de mon Ramoloss de Galar !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
